# Unity-generated
/Library/
/Temp/
/Obj/
/Build/
/Builds/
/Logs/
/UserSettings/
/MemoryCaptures/
/Recordings/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.unityproj
*.tmp
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# The game's assets are exported from the user's own dump (tools/assetripper_export.sh) and never committed.
# Committed under Assets/: Scripts, Editor, Plugins (DOTween vendor), the Wwise .meta files + Wwise settings assets (see
# below), link.xml, StreamingAssets/AK (Wwise marker) and the folder metas of these.
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Scripts/
!/Assets/Scripts.meta
!/Assets/Editor/
!/Assets/Editor.meta
!/Assets/Plugins/
!/Assets/Plugins.meta
!/Assets/Wwise/
!/Assets/Wwise.meta
!/Assets/WwiseSettings.xml
!/Assets/WwiseSettings.xml.meta
!/Assets/link.xml
!/Assets/link.xml.meta
!/Assets/StreamingAssets/
!/Assets/StreamingAssets.meta
/Assets/StreamingAssets/*
!/Assets/StreamingAssets/AK/
!/Assets/StreamingAssets/AK.meta

# Wwise Unity Integration 2019.2.5.1831 is NOT shipped (author, 2026-10-15): each player installs it through the Audiokinetic
# Launcher and the setup copies its files in (+ AkInitializer.LateUpdate / AkGameObj.SetPosition made public, as in the
# shipped game). Kept here: our .meta files (the GUIDs the game's assets reference), the project's Wwise settings assets and
# the Launcher's version record.
/Assets/Wwise/**
!/Assets/Wwise/**/
!/Assets/Wwise/**/*.meta
!/Assets/Wwise/ScriptableObjects/*.asset
!/Assets/Wwise/LauncherInfo.json
/Assets/Wwise/Editor/ProjectData/AkWwiseProjectData.asset*
